# Rust build output
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# The seeded experiment is deterministic (seed 42), so results/ is committed and
# matches the tagged release. `make reproduce` regenerates the same numbers.
# The raw csv, the summary, and analysis_summary.md are the authoritative
# reproducible artifacts; the figures are regenerated from them.

# Raw local mesh run logs. The captured trial runs that the report cites live in
# results/*.log instead, so the noisy per-run logs stay out of git.
/logs/

